OL,6,G1600 Tipping Point
OL,7,     FBen Shephard hosts the quiz in
OL,8,     Fwhich contestants answer questions
OL,9,     Fto win turns on an arcade-style
OL,10,     Fmachine. Dropping tokens down a
OL,11,     Fchoice of four chutes, they hope
OL,12,     Fto knock piles of them off a
OL,13,     Fmoving shelf - and the more they
OL,14,     Fcollect, the greater the prize
OL,15,     Ffund. The player who has won the
OL,16,     Fleast amount is then eliminated,
OL,17,     Fand the last one standing competes
OL,18,     Ffor a #10,000 jackpot
